WEBVTT

00:11:29.597 --> 00:11:31.330
And I think, you know,

00:11:31.363 --> 00:11:36.130
this couldn't be a better time
to be an entrepreneur in the tech world,

00:11:36.163 --> 00:11:41.197
whether it's information technology
or biotechnology or any tech space,

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:43.630
I think it’s a very exciting time.

00:11:43.663 --> 00:11:46.197
Because today it’s not just about biotech,

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:51.863
it's also about the opportunities in AI,

00:11:51.897 --> 00:11:57.030
in, you know, in the kind of,
IOTs and many, many other areas

00:11:57.063 --> 00:12:00.797
which are actually leveraging
information technologies